      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "26",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi yalekhe okhwire Seulo eZifu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana abaZifu nibeetsela Saulo eGibea, nibasunga bari Daudi shiyeebisanga mushikulu shiaHakhila, eshihengaane nende Yeshimoni? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Saulo narula, nakholomokha natsia mushitsiimi shiaZifu, nali nende abandu ebikhumila bitaru, abali nibaloboolwe muIsiraeli, mbu bamukhaabe Daudi mushitsiimi shiaZifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo nakhoma ikambiye mushikulu shiaHakhila, eshihengaane nende Yeshimoni, khunjila. Naye Daudi namenya mushitsiimi, nalola shinga Saulo olwa yali namulondilekhwo okhuula mushitsiimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho mana Daudi naruma abaluuri, namanyilisia habwene shinga Saulo olwa yali niyeetsile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Daudi narula, natsia ewa Saulo yali nakhomile ikambiye; Daudi nalola habundu ewa Saulo yali nakonile, khandi nende Abineri waNeri, omuseesia welihelie; ne Saulo yali nakonile hakari mulwashi, abandu nabo bali nibakhomile amahema kabwe okhumubotokhana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Daudi nareeba Ahimelekhu omuHiti, nende Abishai waZeruya, omusiani wabwe Yoabu, ari Niwina owa nakhukholomoshe ninaye, khutsie ewaSaulo mukambi? Abishai nakalusia mbu Isie nekholomoshe ninawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Daudi nende Abishai niboola ewa abandu bali mushilo; ne lola, Saulo yali nakonile hakari mulwashi, lifumolie nalio nilifumiirwe hasi enamurwewe; ne Abineri nende abandu bali nibakonile nibamubotokhaane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Abishai nasunjila Daudi mbu Nyasaye ahaanile omusukuwo mumukhonokwo leelo; kho bulaano chama emufumire nelifumo elo putu okhuula hasi; emufumire lulala, shindalamufumira khabili ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi nakaania Abishai, mbu Oramwonoonia ta; okhuba niwina ounyala okhukololosia omukhonokwe khumasihi w, mana abule eshiuku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi Daudi nasunga mbu Shinga OMWAMI olwa abeetsangaho mwoyo, OMWAMI alamukhupa, kata induukhoye eyokhufwa yilamunyoola; nohomba alakholomokha natsia mwihe, nakora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Karanyalikha khwisie ta, mbu engololosie omukhono kwanje khumasihi w, tawe; ne bulaano chama obukule lifumo elili enamurwewe, nende eshimuka eshio shiamatsi, khutsie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Daudi nabukula lifumo nende eshimuka shiamatsi ebiali nibili enamurwe waSaulo, nibahwaho; nabulaho owalola, kata okhumanya, kata omundu yesi narasisimukha ta; okhuba bosi bali nibakona tsindoolo; shichila tsindoolo tsinyinji etsiarula ewOMWAMI tsiali nitsibayilile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Daudi niyaambukha injelekha, nasinjila hekulu khushikulu shindi ehalekhwo, ne olwanga olukhongo lwali hakari wabwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi nalanjilisia abandu, nende Abineri waNeri, ari Abineri, shiofuchila ta? Mana Abineri nafuchila, nasunga mbu Niwe wina oukhuumanga omuruchi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi namusunjila Abineri ari Shioli iwe omusaatsa? Niwina ouhelana ninawe muIsiraeli? Kho mbushiina norabeelenje meeso okhulinda omwamiwo omuruchi? Shichila omundu yeenjiile okhwonoonia omuruchi omwamiwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likhuwa lino elia okholile shilili liayi ta. Shinga OMWAMI olwa abeetsangaho mwoyo, mukhoyeele okhufwa, shichila shimubeelenje meeso okhumulinda omwami weenywe, niye masihi wOMWAMI, ta. Kho bulaano, lola ewa lifumo liomuruchi lili, nende eshimuka shiamatsi eshibeele enamurwewe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo namanya omwoyo kwaDaudi; nasunga mbu Okwo nomwoyo kukwo, Daudi omwana wanje? Daudi nasunga mbu Nomwoyo kwanje, omwami wanje, omuruchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasunga mbu Mbushiina omwami wanje niyanondachililanga isie omusumbawo? Okhuba eshia ekholile nishiina? Kata nibubii shiina obuli mumukhono kwanje? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano, ekhusaaya, omwami wanje omuruchi ahulile amakhuwa komusumbawe. Naba nali ye OMWAMI oukhuyakuule khwisie, afuchiilile eshihaanwa; ne nibaba nibali abandu nabandu, babe mushilaamo shiobubii imbeli wOMWAMI; shichila banzilusiye inyanga yino, endeshe okhusanjilana khubulaame bwOMWAMI; bari Tsia okhalabanile abanyasaye bandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano, amabanga kanje kaleshe okhuraatsa hasi nindi ehale nende ewa OMWAMI ali; okhuba omuruchi waIsiraeli arulile okhwenya eshichinji, shinga omundu olwa akhaaba ikhwale mubikulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Saulo nasunga mbu Ndayoonoonilenje; kalukha, omwana wanje Daudi; okhuba shindalakhukholelakhwo libii khandi tawe, shichila obulamu bwanje bubeele bwolukoosi mumonitsio inyanga yino; lola, ndakholile akobusilu, ningosa muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi nakalusia nasunga mbu Lifumu ndielino, E omuruchi! Mulala khubasooliilibo yeetse alibukule. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne OMWAMI alarunga buli mundu obulunjishibwe nende obwisiikwabwe; okhuba leelo OMWAMI akhuhaanile mumukhono kwanje, nasi nindoba okhukololosia omukhono kwanje okhuyinga masihi wOMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne lola, shinga obulamu bubwo olwa bubeele obwolukoosi mumoni tsianje inyanga yino, obulamu bwanje nabwo bube burio obwolukoosi mumoni tsiOMWAMI, naye yambonie mumasila kosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Saulo namusunjila Daudi ari Obe neikhabi, Daudi mwana wanje; witsa okhukhola amakhuwa amakhongo, khandi shiolachweya okhuhula tawe. Kho Daudi natsia butsia, naye Saulo nakalukha ewuwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
